{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02401","headline":"咏淮阴侯 · 王珪","name":"咏淮阴侯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦王日凶慝，豪杰争共亡。\n信亦胡爲者，剑歌从项梁。\n项羽不能用，脱身归汉王。\n道契君臣合，时来名位彰。\n北讨燕承命，东驱楚绝粮。\n斩龙堰濉水，擒豹熸夏阳。\n功成享天禄，建旗还南昌。\n千金答漂母，百钱酬下乡。\n吉凶成纠缠，倚伏难预详。\n弓藏狡兔尽，慷慨念心伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王珪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02401.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02401","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}